<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 15:28:28 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>科学家为实体瘤设计了即用型抗癌 T 细胞</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-engineer-ready-to-use-cancer-fighting-t-cells-for-solid-tumors</link><description>T 细胞受体 (TCR) 疗法是一种癌症治疗方法，可对称为 T 细胞的免疫细胞进行基因重新编程，以精确地捕获癌症。它与另一种治疗方法 CAR T 细胞疗法类似，但有一个关键区别：CAR T 细胞疗法只能发现癌细胞外部自然出现的蛋白质。然而，TCR 疗法还可以捕获细胞内部的小蛋白质片段，这些片段被带到表面并像小名字标签一样展示。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-engineer-ready-to-use-cancer-fighting-t-cells-for-solid-tumors2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 15:28:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-engineer-ready-to-use-cancer-fighting-t-cells-for-solid-tumors</guid></item><item><title>Jamelle Lindo 谈人工智能时代的情商：驾驭情感的力量</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/jamelle-lindo-on-emotional-intelligence-in-the-age-of-ai-harness-the-power-of-emotion</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/jamelle-lindo-on-emotional-intelligence-in-the-age-of-ai-harness-the-power-of-emotion.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 15:13:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/jamelle-lindo-on-emotional-intelligence-in-the-age-of-ai-harness-the-power-of-emotion</guid></item><item><title>为什么 GLP1 可能成为抗衰老突破</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-glp1s-could-be-an-antiaging-breakthrough</link><description>糖尿病药物对心脏、肾脏和大脑显示出惊人的益处。现在，令人兴奋的动物研究表明它们可能会影响衰老本身的生物学。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-glp1s-could-be-an-antiaging-breakthrough.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:58:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-glp1s-could-be-an-antiaging-breakthrough</guid></item><item><title>人类视频机器人训练：Dyna 的 1 百万小时突破提出了正确的问题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/human-video-robot-training-dynas-1mhour-breakthrough-raises-the-right-questions</link><description>Dyna Robotics 于 2026 年 8 月 10 日推出了 DYNA-2，这是一个世界动作模型，经过超过 100 万小时的人类以自我为中心的视频训练，大约有 170 年的连续经验，在预训练过程中使用的机器人数据为零。人类视频机器人训练让 Dyna 报告在高精度制造任务上的任务成功率从 20% 上升到 80-90%。所有这些数据都来自 Dyna 自己的测试，而不是独立的基准测试，这正是它们值得与任何其他供应商报告的结果相同的审查的原因。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/human-video-robot-training-dynas-1mhour-breakthrough-raises-the-right-questions.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:43:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/human-video-robot-training-dynas-1mhour-breakthrough-raises-the-right-questions</guid></item><item><title>ASTRID 追踪 135 亿年的黑洞和星系演化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/astrid-traces-13-5-billion-years-of-black-hole-and-galaxy-evolution</link><description>在夜晚的黑暗天空中，遥远的星光闪烁，诉说着几乎与时间本身一样古老的浩瀚宇宙历史。来自美国宇航局詹姆斯·韦伯太空望远镜等仪器的新数据正在帮助天体物理学家探索深奥的宇宙奥秘，包括黑洞和星系的演化。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/astrid-traces-13-5-billion-years-of-black-hole-and-galaxy-evolution2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:28:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/astrid-traces-13-5-billion-years-of-black-hole-and-galaxy-evolution</guid></item><item><title>慢性疼痛反映在大脑皮层的褶皱和凹槽中</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/chronic-pain-is-reflected-in-the-folds-and-grooves-of-the-cerebral-cortex</link><description>持续性疼痛通常没有明确的原因。然而，研究表明受影响者的大脑结构和活动存在明显差异。这也许可以解释为什么他们会经历慢性疼痛。 “我们的许多研究参与者都很感激有人认真对待他们的症状并对其进行研究，”神经科学家 Salome Häuselmann 说。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chronic-pain-is-reflected-in-the-folds-and-grooves-of-the-cerebral-cortex2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:13:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/chronic-pain-is-reflected-in-the-folds-and-grooves-of-the-cerebral-cortex</guid></item><item><title>DeepMind 的新基因组“图谱”绘制了所有 90 亿个人类基因突变的影响</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/deepminds-new-genome-atlas-charts-effects-of-all-9-billion-human-gene-mutations</link><description>AI 模型 AlphaGenome 可以预测改变​​人类基因组中每一个 DNA 字母的后果。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/deepminds-new-genome-atlas-charts-effects-of-all-9-billion-human-gene-mutations.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 13:58:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/deepminds-new-genome-atlas-charts-effects-of-all-9-billion-human-gene-mutations</guid></item><item><title>激光还是不激光：中微子超辐射的问题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/to-lase-or-not-to-lase-the-question-of-neutrino-superradiance</link><description>两项研究发现，基本的量子约束排除了先前提出的中微子激光方案。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/to-lase-or-not-to-lase-the-question-of-neutrino-superradiance.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 13:43:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/to-lase-or-not-to-lase-the-question-of-neutrino-superradiance</guid></item><item><title>挑战爱因斯坦的光子：根据当前物理学，它永远不应该到达地球</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-photon-that-challenges-einstein-according-to-current-physics-it-should-never-have-reached-earth</link><description>根据已知的物理学，光子应该在到达地球之前很久就被吸收了，但它是如何在超过 20 亿光年的旅程中幸存下来的呢？这是 Giorgio Galanti (INAF) 和 Marco Roncadelli (INFN) 一项新研究的核心问题，该研究已被《物理评论快报》接受发表。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-photon-that-challenges-einstein-according-to-current-physics-it-should-never-have-reached-earth.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 13:28:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-photon-that-challenges-einstein-according-to-current-physics-it-should-never-have-reached-earth</guid></item><item><title>一款新游戏展示了具有可证明经典极限的量子优势</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-new-game-demonstrates-quantum-advantage-with-provable-classical-limits</link><description>几十年来，物理学家一直致力于通过真实的实验来证明量子力学的奇怪预测。随着量子计算机变得越来越强大，研究人员设计了越来越复杂的方法来测试这些机器是否真正利用了量子效应，但迄今为止每种方法都遇到了局限性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-new-game-demonstrates-quantum-advantage-with-provable-classical-limits3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 13:13:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-new-game-demonstrates-quantum-advantage-with-provable-classical-limits</guid></item></channel></rss>